    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "Every complete canonical one-antipodal c=2 candidate factors the punctured order-2^40 binomial into four equal root cells. Their power sums have an exact H-1 flat prefix; moment-kernel combinations orthogonal through w^s vanish through (s+1)H-1 for s=0,1,2. Under negation each such weighted coloring is either exactly invariant or has the printed Vandermonde/MDS support lower bound. This does not classify the colorings or prove C2-PAR.",
